# Railway Environment Variables

## Required (Railway provides or you set these)

DATABASE_URL         → Auto-set by Railway Postgres plugin
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL  → Your Railway domain (e.g. https://traderra.up.railway.app)
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET   → Random 32-char string (generate: openssl rand -hex 16)

## Optional (set if you use these features)

# Auth providers (Google/GitHub OAuth)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=

# APIs
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POLYGON_API_KEY=

# Local dev user bypass
LOCAL_USER_EMAIL=
